# 1. Product Vision

WENDORO is a universal business operating system designed to manage the complete operations of businesses across industries.

It combines ERP, CRM, HRMS, accounting, inventory, ecommerce, marketing, communication, project management, business intelligence and artificial intelligence into one extensible platform.

WENDORO must support:

- Small businesses and startups.
- Medium-sized businesses.
- Large enterprises.
- Multi-company organizations.
- Retailers and wholesalers.
- Ecommerce businesses.
- Manufacturers.
- Real estate businesses.
- Electronics companies.
- Service providers.
- Professional organizations.
- Industry-specific businesses.

The platform must not assume that every customer manufactures or sells physical products.

It must support products, services, subscriptions, rentals, digital goods, assets and custom business entities.

## Core principle

One platform. Multiple industries. Independent applications. Shared business intelligence.

